2216 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 2217 0 R/Alt(Two panels of test accuracy against perturbation level for PING (black) and COBA (red). Left (spike deletion): PING holds near its unperturbed accuracy through 80 percent deletion and degrades only near silence, while COBA drops quickly. Right (Poisson spike addition): PING falls to chance as off-phase noise grows, while COBA tolerates addition. The two configurations show mirror-image asymmetries.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[0]/Pg 14707 0 R>>
endobj
